1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Your indoor cat isn't lazy. They're bored.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Indoor cats are hunters with nothing to hunt.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
So they sleep, overeat, or knock things off your desk.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Fix #1: play like prey. Stalk, chase, pounce, catch.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Fix #2: make them work for food. A toilet-paper tube, a few holes, some kibble.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Fix #3: go vertical. A cleared shelf is a whole new room to a cat.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
This guide has 30 ideas like that, most from stuff you already own.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Plus a 4-week calendar so you never wonder what to do tonight.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Indoor Cat Enrichment Guide. Printable PDF, link in bio.
